        "original_id": "9238fdfb-dd50-5f76-a6a6-7d121be6bcdf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Hurt Locker (musical)\n- People: Taye Diggs, James Hetfield, Lars Ulrich, Kirk Hammett, Robert Trujillo, Stephen R. Schwartz, Stephen Trask\n- Companies/Groups: Metallica\n- Documents: Playbills\n- Roles: Hedwig\n\nFacts:\n- The Playbills for Hurt Locker described the musical as having \"explosions, negligible storytelling, camouflage and tits.\"\n- The Playbills for Hurt Locker stated that the cast included Taye Diggs.\n- In summer 2015, Taye Diggs went on to play the role of Hedwig.\n- The music for Hurt Locker was credited to Metallica and Stephen R. Schwartz.\n- Stephen R. Schwartz is the real name of Hedwig songwriter Stephen Trask.\n- Metallica's current lineup comprises founding members James Hetfield and Lars Ulrich, longtime lead guitarist Kirk Hammett, and bassist Robert Trujillo.",
